Microsoft = select, DIRECT, PROXY, "🇭🇰 香港节点", "🇺🇸 美国节点", "🇯🇵 日本节点", "🇰🇷 韩国节点", "🇸🇬 新加坡节点", icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Windows.png, no-alert=0, hidden=1, include-all-proxies=0

